1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:02,760
This is BlockID Business Passport:

2
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:04,745
know the business you invest in.

3
00:00:04,745 --> 00:00:07,276
A live, checked view of the business you own,

4
00:00:07,276 --> 00:00:09,245
with dividends paid to your wallet.

5
00:00:10,190 --> 00:00:13,832
Today, investors lose sight of a business once they invest.

6
00:00:13,832 --> 00:00:15,567
The numbers are hard to trust,

7
00:00:15,567 --> 00:00:18,749
ownership sits in spreadsheets, and dividends are slow,

8
00:00:18,749 --> 00:00:19,559
or never come.

9
00:00:20,522 --> 00:00:21,986
The need is large.

10
00:00:21,986 --> 00:00:25,445
Alternative assets are heading to thirty-two trillion dollars by 2030,

11
00:00:25,445 --> 00:00:29,200
and venture investors put in four hundred and twenty-five billion last year.

12
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:33,603
Yet in 2024, private equity paid back just eleven percent of its

13
00:00:33,603 --> 00:00:35,117
value, a ten-year low.

14
00:00:36,062 --> 00:00:38,550
Here is the live app, on testnet.

15
00:00:38,550 --> 00:00:42,605
No sign-up: a demo investor sees each holding at the latest approved

16
00:00:42,605 --> 00:00:44,871
price, and the dividends already paid.

17
00:00:45,818 --> 00:00:47,612
Each holding shows your stake,

18
00:00:47,612 --> 00:00:49,943
a price that moves only after approval,

19
00:00:49,943 --> 00:00:51,079
and shared updates.

20
00:00:52,046 --> 00:00:54,474
To check a business, paste its website.

21
00:00:54,474 --> 00:00:56,056
Our research tools read it,

22
00:00:56,056 --> 00:00:58,926
find competitors and study the market in minutes.

23
00:00:58,926 --> 00:01:01,200
They draft; people decide.

24
00:01:02,138 --> 00:01:04,780
You get a grade, a score and a value range,

25
00:01:04,780 --> 00:01:07,054
and every figure links to its source.

26
00:01:08,006 --> 00:01:10,506
A named person approves every step.

27
00:01:10,506 --> 00:01:12,597
No one can approve their own request,

28
00:01:12,597 --> 00:01:14,970
and nothing reaches the chain before that.

29
00:01:15,938 --> 00:01:19,752
The share register is written to BlockID chain and copied to Ethereum

30
00:01:19,752 --> 00:01:20,747
and HashKey Chain.

31
00:01:21,710 --> 00:01:24,852
Businesses open offerings with the dilution shown first,

32
00:01:24,852 --> 00:01:27,376
and dividends reach every wallet with no gas.

33
00:01:28,346 --> 00:01:29,619
Don't trust us.

34
00:01:29,619 --> 00:01:32,810
Your browser checks the report against three blockchains.

35
00:01:32,810 --> 00:01:35,381
Change one number, and it turns red.

36
00:01:36,326 --> 00:01:38,030
Investors get a checked value,

37
00:01:38,030 --> 00:01:39,904
the same update at the same time,

38
00:01:39,904 --> 00:01:42,290
proof of ownership, and dividends on time.

39
00:01:42,290 --> 00:01:45,316
In return, the business keeps a live share register,

40
00:01:45,316 --> 00:01:46,945
as the law already requires,

41
00:01:46,945 --> 00:01:50,087
reports on schedule, and has every new share approved.

42
00:01:51,050 --> 00:01:55,387
On-chain real-world assets grew from about seven to thirty-nine billion dollars in

43
00:01:55,387 --> 00:01:58,930
nineteen months, and Citi expects five and a half trillion by 2030.

44
00:01:58,930 --> 00:02:00,868
New rules demand proper custody:

45
00:02:00,868 --> 00:02:04,261
in BlockID, keys sit in one locked-down signing service,

46
00:02:04,261 --> 00:02:06,502
and a licensed custodian can plug in.

47
00:02:07,454 --> 00:02:09,744
BlockID HR checks the founding team:

48
00:02:09,744 --> 00:02:12,989
each requirement against public sources and the CV.

49
00:02:13,946 --> 00:02:15,124
Who builds it?

50
00:02:15,124 --> 00:02:17,885
Founder Do Van Long and co-founder Truong Quoc Tuan,

51
00:02:17,885 --> 00:02:22,293
both former CTOs of major Vietnamese corporations and holders of Australia's Global

52
00:02:22,293 --> 00:02:25,479
Talent visa, lead a tech team in Vietnam and a business team

53
00:02:25,479 --> 00:02:27,338
in Sydney, built to scale globally.

54
00:02:28,286 --> 00:02:30,462
Today the full flow runs on testnet:

55
00:02:30,462 --> 00:02:34,572
fourteen sample listings, forty-two token contracts on three chains,

56
00:02:34,572 --> 00:02:37,655
every report verified, and over five hundred tests.

57
00:02:37,655 --> 00:02:39,405
No real users yet.

58
00:02:40,370 --> 00:02:43,455
Everything you saw runs today on BlockID Chain,

59
00:02:43,455 --> 00:02:45,227
Ethereum and HashKey Chain.

60
00:02:45,227 --> 00:02:48,267
We invite Ethereum investors to back our first pilots,

61
00:02:48,267 --> 00:02:51,870
and layer one and layer two teams to run BlockID on their chain.

62
00:02:51,870 --> 00:02:54,500
Try it at eth dot blockid dot au.
